WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.635
You already have a book,
a talk or a brand.

2
00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.886
Can I help you launch it?

3
00:00:05.286 --> 00:00:06.096
Yes.

4
00:00:06.496 --> 00:00:08.624
We use the Launch Portal.

5
00:00:08.824 --> 00:00:10.994
You answer a set of questions, and

6
00:00:10.994 --> 00:00:12.932
it turns your answers into one

7
00:00:12.932 --> 00:00:15.025
plan, for your brand, your book,

8
00:00:15.025 --> 00:00:17.660
your talk, your bookings
and your press.

9
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.521
Then you get a dashboard that

10
00:00:19.521 --> 00:00:23.706
shows every step, so you always
know what's done and what's next.

11
00:00:23.706 --> 00:00:27.427
You've already done the hard part
by creating something.

12
00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.675
Now let's get it out into
the world.
